  "description": "Graphics Mill Templates is a library which allows loading Adobe Photoshop (PSD) files as templates or mockups, personalize them by replacing the content of its layers (text and images) and export results to JPEG, TIFF or PDF format. For example, it can be used for variable data printing applications (e.g. to generate printing product based on templates) or create pseudo-3D preview images using Smart Objects for such goods like bottles, cups, t-shirts, etc. The library is based on the Graphics Mill imaging SDK. \n\nIMPORTANT: This version is targeted for x64 environment. For x86 applications, please use the package named Graphics Mill Templates (x86).",
